### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@candidateToken = YOUR_CANDIDATE_JWT_HERE

### 1. Get Logged-in Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

### 2. Update Profile
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

{
  "name": "Jane Candidate",
  "bio": "Full-stack software engineer with deep expertise in Docker, React, Node.js, TypeScript, and MongoDB architectures."
}

### 3. Extract Technical Skills from Bio (AI NER Model)
POST {{baseUrl}}/profile/extract-skills
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

### 4. Change Password
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/profile/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

{
  "currentPassword": "Password123!",
  "newPassword": "NewStrongPassword456!"
}
